# NOTE: Git only treats '#' as a comment at the START of a line. A trailing
# comment would become part of the pattern, so every note here sits on its own
# line above the rule it explains.

# --- build artefacts ---
# myos64.bin, wallpaper.bin, ai/ai_model.bin and the disk images all live here.
*.o
*.obj
*.elf
*.flat
*.bin
*.iso
*.img

